TI  - Investigating the Incidence of Value Added Tax on Households Income: New Evidence from Italy
AU  - Cirillo, Cristina
AU  - Imperioli, Lucia
AU  - Manzo, Marco
VL  - 14
IS  - 3
PY  - 2021
DA  - 2021/12/31
